WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.880
Dhalsim begins with standing light punch into crouching light punch.

2
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:01.850
The green Drive Rush effect appears as Dhalsim extends the light confirm.

3
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:02.200
Back medium punch lifts the opponent after the rushed crouching light punch.

4
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:02.700
Medium Yoga Blast catches the opponent in front of Dhalsim.

5
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.020
The opponent falls after medium Blast.
